      "values:originalText": "Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\n\n\n\nNo. 5, 2024\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Combatting Foreign Bribery) Act"
