        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-combatting-foreign-bribery-act-2024-sch-1-sec-11",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11 Subsection 26-52(2)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-combatting-foreign-bribery-act-2024#sch-1-sec-11"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-combatting-foreign-bribery-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-combatting-foreign-bribery-act-2024.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(2) An amount is a bribe to a foreign public official to the extent that:\n(a) you incur the amount in, or in connection with:\n(i) providing a benefit to another person; or\n(ii) causing a benefit to be provided to another person; or\n(iii) offering to provide, or promising to provide, a benefit to\nanother person; or\n(iv) causing an offer of the provision of a benefit, or a\npromise of the provision of a benefit, to be made to\nanother person; and\n(b) you incur the amount with the intention of improperly\ninfluencing a *foreign public official (who may be the other\nperson) in order to obtain or retain business or a business or\npersonal advantage (whether or not for yourself).\nThe benefit may be any advantage and is not limited to property.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(2) An amount is a bribe to a foreign public official to the extent that:\n(a) you incur the amount in, or in connection with:\n(i) providing a benefit to another person; or\n(ii) causing a benefit to be provided to another person; or\n(iii) offering to provide, or promising to provide, a benefit to\nanother person; or\n(iv) causing an offer of the provision of a benefit, or a\npromise of the provision of a benefit, to be made to\nanother person; and\n(b) you incur the amount with the intention of improperly\ninfluencing a *foreign public official (who may be the other\nperson) in order to obtain or retain business or a business or\npersonal advantage (whether or not for yourself).\nThe benefit may be any advantage and is not limited to property.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-combatting-foreign-bribery-act-2024-sch-1-sec-11-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-combatting-foreign-bribery-act-2024-sch-1-sec-11-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3c40cdb247d1a64ff9e9df699f69b4ab825b8715be0badfb18606a8e4e2956c1",
      "skos:note": "Repeal of subsection and substitution with new provision regarding bribes to foreign public officials."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-combatting-foreign-bribery-act-2024#sch-1-sec-11",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "11 Subsection 26-52(2)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(2) An amount is a bribe to a foreign public official to the extent that:\n(a) you incur the amount in, or in connection with:\n(i) providing a benefit to another person; or\n(ii) causing a benefit to be provided to another person; or\n(iii) offering to provide, or promising to provide, a benefit to\nanother person; or\n(iv) causing an offer of the provision of a benefit, or a\npromise of the provision of a benefit, to be made to\nanother person; and\n(b) you incur the amount with the intention of improperly\ninfluencing a *foreign public official (who may be the other\nperson) in order to obtain or retain business or a business or\npersonal advantage (whether or not for yourself).\nThe benefit may be any advantage and is not limited to property."
    },
