      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-combatting-foreign-bribery-act-2024.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments of the Income Tax Assessment Act 1997 made by this\nPart apply to a loss or outgoing incurred on or after the commencement\nof Part 1 of this Schedule.\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 22 June 2023\nSenate on 6 September 2023]\n(135/22)",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments of the Income Tax Assessment Act 1997 made by this\nPart apply to a loss or outgoing incurred on or after the commencement\nof Part 1 of this Schedule.\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 22 June 2023\nSenate on 6 September 2023]\n(135/22)",
      "cml:asserts": [
